{
  "__comment": [
    "Brewery workshop recipe definitions.",
    "Loaded when a dwarf is assigned a BREW task — NOT held in memory at boot.",
    "",
    "Top-level keys:",
    "  workshop_key — the block URI this file belongs to",
    "  recipes      — array of recipe objects",
    "",
    "Recipe object fields:",
    "  id            — permanent namespaced URI; never rename after first save",
    "  display_name  — shown in the workshop queue UI",
    "  inputs        — array of { item, count }; all must be in accessible stockpile",
    "  outputs       — array of { item, count }; placed in nearest output stockpile on completion",
    "  work_time     — in-game hours a dwarf spends at the workshop block",
    "  skill_bonus   — each point of skill_brewing above 1 reduces work_time by this fraction",
    "                  e.g. 0.05 at skill 5 = 4 × 0.05 = 20% faster",
    "  required_skill — minimum skill_brewing level to unlock this recipe (0 = always available)",
    "  category      — UI grouping tag: 'ale' | 'stout' | 'mead' | 'cider' | 'wine' | 'spirit' | 'processed_goods'"
  ],

